{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3ea9906cd3d23c004b82d33d2d5e2f584774eb0e71cf86a17f410a8cfa6b8b40","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"juyterman1000/entroly@9bab5850955c snapshot 123494e15847ef5e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9384cc61c3b801b0d6c9d243e42f4b2b384c316aa3c0b68d79de7773f6c8d650","slc_d89d5f4b0826685b5683f9af0299dd4e7d3cf08c7553b3c30cf1177678dafed6"],"source_ids":["src_b25a369e349f5972be07fea131245a25"],"text":"The MCP server is configured with environment flags such as ENTROLY_NO_DOCKER, ENTROLY_MCP_PASSIVE, and ENTROLY_MAX_FILES, and the MCP path is provider-neutral across many model vendors.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3fe9aa7c7a429b28933df118f007705dfb45c4fb3fe4fdcdc24ebb10fbdcd8ee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"juyterman1000/entroly@9bab5850955c snapshot 123494e15847ef5e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fa71be0f4906684b45fb31e9739ab2ba799df3deba0ae606525a3fd745ad959e"],"source_ids":["src_0f8c86d4a754592bbe99689e7b7ffda7"],"text":"The design preserves provider protocol, headers, tools, parameters, ordering, and cache semantics, transforming only injected context and output; model/params/tools are never mutated unless transparent routing is explicitly enabled, and then recorded in the receipt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_551e8021d8b300c19859550e0f6a632af04b9a2db97bebc609283a06d515aea7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"juyterman1000/entroly@9bab5850955c snapshot 123494e15847ef5e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8d0f9aa2e50be71d0aebe5f251f9fa25124ddad7aec01e18005f65dc7ced9726","slc_ba55f1c339bb0b691c3dbe323c7a9f4b192bd5446eef18cd893a08cf3e2ba00f","slc_fa33c91c21cfbe149ce703fdf612fa28d4b7f16472c78ac1e639fed3a11b8d73"],"source_ids":["src_b25a369e349f5972be07fea131245a25"],"text":"Benchmark tables report accuracy retention with gpt-4o-mini and Wilson 95% CIs across NeedleInAHaystack, GSM8K, SQuAD 2.0, MMLU, TruthfulQA, and LongBench, with an average retention of 101.7%.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_64e412b2c005ef9438889441f89bd7854a1102d5ea15c2b2a9bf018402042fd4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"juyterman1000/entroly@9bab5850955c snapshot 123494e15847ef5e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_214d672cf6ca113fe8dd513d0956eac1c1749a2921d39fe7cfa2d7fb1a7d8afc","slc_a3804947bf77bdcf9d7fb45d258928711d68e9f3009cfee9075f2953d34b6cfb"],"source_ids":["src_b25a369e349f5972be07fea131245a25"],"text":"Stated good fits are large repos where agents see few files at a time, chatty multi-turn agents, and evidence-checked answers; tiny repos or prompts already within budget are cases to skip.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91"}
